 "description": "Trace up to four redirects across approved public HTTPS hosts. PAID: 1000 micro-dollar service credits per successful call. First use agent_utilities_prepare for this tool. Requires existing credits and a private Authorization header. Reuse prepared arguments for recovery; a new requestId is a new billable operation.",
